@startuml
title Weather Monitoring System - User Authentication, Location Selection, and Weather Information

[*] --> LoginOrRegister : [Prompt user to choose]

state LoginOrRegister <<choice>>
LoginOrRegister --> Register : [New user]
LoginOrRegister --> LogIn : [Registered user]

state Register <<choice>>
Register --> SuccessfulRegistration : [Details are valid]
Register --> InvalidRegistration : [Details are invalid]

state LogIn <<choice>>
LogIn --> SuccessfulLogin : [Username and password match]
LogIn --> InvalidLogin : [Invalid username or password]

state UserDashboard <<choice>>
UserDashboard --> LocationSelection : [Check weather for current or another location]
UserDashboard --> ProfileManagement : [Edit details, upload or accept requests, search for other users, or view current deals]
UserDashboard --> Logout : [Log out after completing tasks]

state UserDashboard_LocationSelection <<choice>>
UserDashboard_LocationSelection --> ValidLocation : [Enter a valid location]
UserDashboard_LocationSelection --> InvalidLocation : [Enter an invalid location]
UserDashboard_LocationSelection --> UserDashboard : [Return to user dashboard]

state WeatherInformationChoice <<choice>>
WeatherInformationChoice --> Temperature : [Temperature]
WeatherInformationChoice --> Humidity : [Humidity]
WeatherInformationChoice --> Rainfall : [Rainfall]
WeatherInformationChoice --> Pressure : [Pressure]
WeatherInformationChoice --> DewPoint : [Dew point]

state WeatherDetails <<choice>>
WeatherDetails --> Alerts : [Alerts]
WeatherDetails --> WeeklyAnalysis : [Weekly analysis]
WeatherDetails --> FuturePrediction : [Future prediction]
WeatherDetails --> Graph : [Graph]
WeatherDetails --> UserDashboard_LocationSelection : [Return to location selection]

state Logout_UserDashboard <<choice>>
Logout_UserDashboard --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
@enduml
